From d3205ab6c8c77353226d3ac479d3fc722934bf64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ridong Chen <chenridong@xiaomi.corp-partner.google.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 21:25:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ANDROID: gki: update xiaomi symbol list and abi for new vendor hooks

Add the following symbols to the xiaomi symbol list and update
abi.stg for the new MGLRU swappiness vendor hooks:

- android_vh_mglru_should_run_aging
- android_vh_mglru_scan_folios
- android_vh_mglru_inc_min_seq
- android_vh_mglru_skip_min_seq_balance

Bug: 564798566
Change-Id: Ib106d5652dfbae0cca207402305316a4ac11c3cd
Signed-off-by: Ridong Chen <chenridong@xiaomi.corp-partner.google.com>


Backport: retain only the matching Xiaomi symbol-list additions; regenerate ABI reference metadata from the target build.
---
diff --git a/gki/aarch64/symbols/xiaomi b/gki/aarch64/symbols/xiaomi
--- a/gki/aarch64/symbols/xiaomi
+++ b/gki/aarch64/symbols/xiaomi
@@ -672,2 +672,12 @@
 
+
+# MGLRU swappiness vendor hooks
+__traceiter_android_vh_mglru_should_run_aging
+__tracepoint_android_vh_mglru_should_run_aging
+__traceiter_android_vh_mglru_scan_folios
+__tracepoint_android_vh_mglru_scan_folios
+__traceiter_android_vh_mglru_inc_min_seq
+__tracepoint_android_vh_mglru_inc_min_seq
+__traceiter_android_vh_mglru_skip_min_seq_balance
+__tracepoint_android_vh_mglru_skip_min_seq_balance
 # folio writeback hooks
